        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9d47d847-c2dc-4f6d-b0e9-6d719560418e).Image",
        "Description": "Listen up 40oz, this is some serious shit!\r\rThis no good biker gang been pushin that white powder on my block. I need you to take out there leader, this Serbin Kaiser guy.  Make yourself look like one of them biker boy and shoot him with a loud Pistol. Maybe take out some of them other fools too! \rTheres 7K Cash when the job is done\rOh! take out that Bouncer man!!\r\rDiana: 47 we need to remove Witold Schuchert. He&apos;s the one who ships the Drugs out of EU on to the &quot;streets&quot; of our client.",
